{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfu1sVTjE5eWud63Pfjco","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Recommendation: don't start the receipt app now\n\n**The math doesn't work.** Filing needs all four engineers until March. If you move two of them to receipts, filing slips by about three months, past the April deadline. That deadline is fixed by regulation, and it's this year's whole strategy. If filing is late, customers who have to comply will go to competitors who are ready. That costs far more than a receipt app could win back. Also, a feature that's 60% done usually has more work left than the estimate shows, so the March date has little slack already.\n\n**Marketing's evidence is weaker than it looks:**\n- **The blog search term shows interest in a topic, not demand for an app.** People searching \"receipts\" may just want to know which records HMRC requires. You can serve that with content now, at no engineering cost.\n- **A competitor launching something doesn't make it urgent.** Sole traders choose software for compliance before the deadline. A receipt app won't win them if your filing isn't ready.\n\n**What to do instead:**\n1. **Now:** Have marketing write receipt-focused content that leads to the filing feature, e.g. \"What records do you need for quarterly updates?\" Capture emails from interested readers.\n2. **Cheap test:** Add a \"Snap receipts – coming soon\" waitlist, or test a receipt-scanning partner integration if one fits within a few days of work.\n3. **April or later:** Revisit receipts as the next bet. It fits well after filing, since receipts feed the digital records people need for quarterly filing. You'll also have waitlist data to size it.\n\n**What would change my answer:** filing finishing early, or the deadline being pushed back."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3189,"cache_read_input_tokens":5025,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3189},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3dc1246e-2333-46ba-ac62-29249bd298be","uuid":"f4c6b0f7-f67e-45ef-8d2a-5f7f2cdccc7a","timestamp":"2026-10-10T18:17:54.036Z","request_id":"req_011Cfu1sVDMJvGBWZbWc6Mhx"}
